            "details": "There is no complete inline mitigation for this issue; the fix requires upgrading golang.org/x/image to version 0.43.0 or later, which validates the strip offset before use. Where an immediate upgrade is not possible, exposure can be reduced by not decoding untrusted or externally supplied TIFF images, or by isolating TIFF decoding in a sandboxed, restartable worker process so a panic does not crash the primary service.",
